# Basic sanity check on the SV08 config
# Test case for the Sovol SV08 (2023, original toolhead) config
CONFIG ../../config/printer-sovol-sv08-2023.cfg
DICTIONARY stm32f103.dict extra_mcu=stm32f103.dict

# Z on this machine is a probe_eddy_current sensor.  It can only report a
# position once the sensor has been calibrated on the real machine
# (PROBE_EDDY_CURRENT_CALIBRATE), and that calibration is deliberately not
# shipped in the example config, so "G28" (as used by printers.test) cannot
# work here.  Home X and Y sensorlessly and fake Z instead, which still
# exercises both MCUs, the toolhead LDC1612 sensor on its software I2C bus,
# the sensorless homing pins and all four axes.
G28 X
G28 Y
SET_KINEMATIC_POSITION Z=5 SET_HOMED=z
G1 Z10 F600
G1 X10 Y10 F3000
GET_POSITION
